# PRODUCT.md

## Overview
**Product name:** Atlas - Sistema de Gestión de Activos Universitarios  
**Tagline:** "Visibilidad total para mantener tu universidad en movimiento."  
**Description:** A web application for managing university assets, work orders, and maintenance history. It provides centralized inventory management with operational health tracking.

## Target audience
- University operations/maintenance teams
- Facilities management staff
- IT/technical staff responsible for equipment
- Administrative personnel managing university assets

## Core features
1. Dashboard with key metrics (total assets, operational, priority, estimated value)
2. Asset inventory management (CRUD)
3. Work orders (creation, tracking)
4. Maintenance history/incidents tracking
5. Smart alerts for overdue maintenance and out-of-service assets
6. Filtering and search capabilities

## Surface to improve/design
The main interface is `main/core/templates/core/index.html` (Django template). This is an Operate mode interface (task-focused dashboard for managing assets).

## Constraints
- Built with Django + Django REST Framework backend
- Frontend is a single-page HTML template with vanilla JS, CSS variables
- Spanish language interface
- Must maintain existing API compatibility (`/api/storages/...`)
- Works in desktop and responsive mobile views
